130003,nomJbjuQXAY,Ugz9Q-EhVWKd6Aiyxkt4AaABAg,2022-09-14T15:50:56Z,53,5,"Been reading the Manga since last year and even bought the first 2 volumes! I'm really hoping that the anime adaption would be great! Especially the music too!

I even can't wait to see Bocchi and Ikuyo's faces whenever they feel depressed or embarassed especially since that is one of the main highlights of the manga! One of the closest characters I can relate to is Nijika, the blonde hair ponytail girl because she's a drummer and I for one used to be playing drums back in high school through I'm not pro but I loved playing it! It makes me want to go back to playing drums after seeing her play!

If you're thinking of giving it a read, you should try before watching the anime! Bocchi often saves the day whenever something goes wrong but man, she's really hilarious so I can't wait to see her in anime form!"
