146065,ts5NGoDI1V0,UgzO4AF7CCIKkYRsNv54AaABAg,2023-06-04T20:21:19Z,0,0,"It's kind of bittersweet seeing this. The animation looks beautifull and the first two seasons were super well made.  This is one of the best made anime series by way of art direction, animation quality, soundscape and feeling. They also setup a lot of potential for character development and the world building is great. But I do not like the direction the story takes in later light novel volumes, it goes kinda stupid and imo throws away a lot of potential character development.
This season is luckily still at the part where the story is decent, but it's downhill from here. I had to stop reading the light novel after forcing myself through a few volumes. I stopped at volume 18 or 19. The hope of it getting good again kept me going, and at parts it did get good again. But then it went worse again and at some point I lost hope. Maybe it does get better again later. I hope it does. Maybe after some more times passes i'll give the later volumes another chance."
