146065,ts5NGoDI1V0,UgxzUmYoeoNmFwLsi9t4AaABAg,2023-06-01T10:07:59Z,0,2,"I loved Mushoku Tensei so much that i went ahead and read the light novel. Unfortunately, at some point, i started disliking Rudeus, even though i loved him before. I didn't like the situation with his love relationship(s), and hated that he seemed to lack independence. His actions are always dictated by external circumstances. Except when he went on a quest to find his mom. I stopped reading when i realized that all the actions taken by Rudeus were to fulfil some other guys goal. What about Rudeus' goals though? And there is no reason why Rudeus should care about that other dude's goal. Why doesn't Rudeus go his own way, and do his own thing, like the man he is?"
