104157,o0TZj_d3Yfg,UgzyLEuKom2ld80CPkd4AaABAg,2021-12-04T06:45:10Z,53,16,"After watching the entire season 1 in two days and then after 1 day watching a movie about it, I feel kinda rude to not have noticed this anime 2 years prior and now watching the trailer. The anime is absolutely amazing, believe it or not. I know everyone has different opinions, some may like anime, some don’t or their are just different personal aspects that everyone prefers to see in an anime such as romance, adventure and etc. But this is a well done anime that I have seen in a while. I never watched anime before, unless if you could consider moments that I had when I was younger when I watched Cartoon Network and their used to be a show “Bakugan” or I’ve seen some clips from “Naruto”, but this… this is one of my first ever animes that I’ve dedicated to watch entirely and I genuinely believe it’s a great master piece (yes my first ever anime that I’ve seen fully). The movie was very emotional, that I’ve decided to watch the season all over again. I don’t know how to even more accurately describe and express how I feel about this show, I just hope, whoever is reading my comment here right now, could emotionally understand me in regards to how fantastic this series is. I really do hope that there will be an official Season 2 confirmation and announcement, because I can;t wait to see it myself, but the only thing that pains me just a bit is that any great piece of work requires a tremendous amount of time to complete, and judging by the internet resources, if everything works out, we’d probably expect Season 2 in either (if we are lucky enough) late 2021 (to which I’ll be surprised if it comes out during this month, it’s 4.12.2021 right now btw) OR late 2022, which is another year of wait. I’m not sure whether the pandemic impacted the development and creation process of the series during 2020 and if the project was temporarily shut down (well maybe shutdown is not the write term for this, more like paused), but all I can say and stay put as of right now, is that I really, really do wish and hope that there will be a season 2, and better yet even more seasons afterwards. I really feel like 5-7 seasons would be enough in my opinion 😁😊😉🙂, but of course that’s not for me to decide. If anyone from this community reads my comment and feels the same about this series as I have described it, please like the comment, I don’t aim to go viral or popular somehow due to this comment, I just genuinely want to know how many other people enjoyed this show. 

P.S. Just one more thing before I go, if anyone of you has any information regarding Season 2, please let me know with a reply to this comment. But no spoilers pls. And if anyone could please mention and recommend any other anime series similar to this one, that I could watch or has a similar, if not almost the exact same animation style, because I’ve been looking and searching through some recommended animes to watch, but I’m struggling to find one, so it would be very appreciated if you guys know any and could help me out a bit. Thank you for all of your time that it took you to read my message and have a great day, nice evening, good night, bon appetite, wish you all the best, or whatever is happening to you at the moment. 🤝👍👋"
