104157,o0TZj_d3Yfg,UgxfQCrtOcoS1ICSRGp4AaABAg,2021-09-26T03:05:55Z,2,2,"So, I used to think that animes are nothing special, they are just animated dramas with romance and other genres. I had this perception about it because I had only known that some animes are just cheesy and many animes are like that. Of course I knew that every anime can't be the same just as every movie or every person is not the same. One day, in shorts, I got to see a little clip from A silent voice. It made me so curious that what must have happened that I had to watch it. I don't think I need to tell that it is probably THE BEST anime. I was happy that as my first anime, I had watched something great. Then I searched if there are any other anime as good as A silent voice or have similar kind of story. Someone recommended me Your name. I got to know that it is romance but everyone said it is different. I watched it. Now, I am obsessed with it. Then, I watched Weathering with you which is from the same creator. But these were all movies. Again, youtube was the one who introduced me to this anime - Bunny girl Senpai (I know its full name). To be honest, like most of the guys, I also thought it is some cheesy story (I had seen the part where Sakuta and Tomoe first meet😂). Though I am generally not interested in such shows, I don't know why but I searched for this show. And the fact that I couldn't really find it anywhere to watch it properly made me decide I AM GOING TO WATCH IT (I know it is a bit childish of me).  Then I watched it and I don't know anymore what to say. It was awesome. But somewhere I think I didn't understand it completely, because it is so deep. But tears didn't stop from my eyes, especially in the last episode."
