171627,EPaoHkV0dYw,UgyU8gdg2-J4dLzEFqZ4AaABAg,2025-09-15T16:10:46Z,1,1,"Ever since Demon Slayer: Mugen Train, anime films in America have been getting treated like actual movies rather than just a special event.

Gone are the days where an anime film would only be featured in select theaters, distributed by lesser known companies (like Fathom Events), for a very limited time on specific days.

Seeing these films getting distributed by huge film companies like Sony, is crazy to think about. The fact that they even got Channing Tatum to appear in the English Dub of Infinity Castle is INSANE!

I hope more anime films like this & Demon Slayer: Infinity Castle are able to get this level of love and support from Hollywood."
