158927,W2tMsaAVjD0,UgzqC2C-X5m3LvfUwd14AaABAg,2024-04-20T17:16:12Z,0,0,"I am... heartbroken. 

I watched the show on a whim. A wholesome action family comedy? Sounds like fun.
First season flies like a plane. Every single character is so much fun. Anya is actually cute and not annoying, Loid and Yor are so badass and their ""which side is true and which is fake"" conflicts are so interesting. The plot goes fast, characters get introduced AND they develop. There is so much fun AND emotion.

Season 3... Its a slice of life that never actually goes anywhere and all the ""depth"" was exhausted by the first season, with the second season just not being... as obvious...

Jesus, Mob Psycho spoiled me so much I can't watch a show and care for the characters knowing that nothing is going to happen with them... Loid will never break through his Spy persona, Yor will never face her job as an assassin AND mother, Anya will never again say her parents ""I love you"" in a meaningful way..."
