153518,n5JEoD7keVo,Ugz1fs9wN465teGO-kd4AaABAg,2023-11-06T17:10:22Z,461,4,"As much as it is geared towards the gourmet aspect, it has a wonderful spine of a narrative running through it, and was truly a surprise in it's depth of conception. Definitely not your run-of-the-mill adventure story, defeat-something-and-advance trope. And above all it is charming, charming and thoughtful, that you cannot help but adore. The characters and their interaction with the unfolding plot and encounters are truly what make you stay with the story. I'm superbly excited for the anime. Manga, I've understood, unlike novels-to-movie, when produced in the anime form competently, always, always compounds the pleasure, adds to the viewers experience,there is no loss in translation. Cannot wait to lose myself in the anime.❤"
