153518,U3veqJewdto,UgwWP0X3cG4T5IihEkF4AaABAg,2023-11-25T12:41:10Z,6,0,"This is one of my most favorite mangas of all time and I followed it religiously since 2018. I am so happy to see it getting animated but I was wondering why they credited a ""character designer"" for the anime when the character designs were all made by ryoko kui (the mangaka, writer, and creator). I'd understand if they changed the character designs drastically to make them easier to animate but I don't see much change here. I just think Kui deserves so much of the credit for bringing this world to life.

If you're ever curious of her designing process too, you can look at some of her ""side"" work (daydream hour) expanding on her design concepts and drawing style. I really think she's one of the better character artists of our time."
