153518,U3veqJewdto,Ugzqk-gHlAHYJfLtXFF4AaABAg,2023-07-02T01:36:26Z,2362,26,"For those wondering about this unique series, in a nutshell it's about a party of adventurers exploring a dungeon to save their teammates, but even though it's the main goal, the focus of this anime is an episodic adventure featuring the ecosystem and lives within the dungeon itself and most importantly how it could be incorporated into cooking a new food. It's pretty interesting and a fun relaxing series

