177709,9TbmxbckSjE,UgzNOfRzHxELv1QRsBF4AaABAg,2025-01-05T05:27:06Z,0,0,"Has anyone seen all the flack this has been getting? Mainly from Japan. People are saying, and they're going off of trailers, that the choreography in the fight scenes is terrible and doesn't live up to the manga. The voice acting doesn't match their characters at all, and the funniest thing is people saying the animation is sloppy and should never even get released looking this bad. 

I don't understand how you could judge this anime as any of those things. It looks AMAZING!!  Plus you literally see nearly what? 3 seconds of fight scene? Lol the YouTube channel owners have been deleting the harsh comments on these trolls to try and shut them up. I think that's gangster of them foreal. People should be raising hell about the short seasons and long time in between them instead. Hell it's VERYYY rare that an anime is completed anymore compared to its counterpart mangas and such. Anime is dead! It's starting to get real sad! If it isn't Pokemon or One Piece you better pick up a manga quick cause u may get a 13 episodes season of something one day and end up waiting 4 years for the next 13 episodes. That's if it ever gets picked back up in the first place at all. Hell Re:Zero still ain't done and it's been what 10 or 15 years? We just finally got season 3 after a 5 plus year wait."
