177709,9TbmxbckSjE,UgzYQfpro3WSqQsKZTt4AaABAg,2024-12-04T17:45:10Z,0,0,"Ah, so he never loses weight and gets healthy again!? 😥 Him being portrayed as in shape again? 💪 It's just a ""metaphor for him regaining his peak abilities,"" not literal weight loss, so I think it's lame as hell! 🤬👿😠 IMHO - IN MY HUMBLE OPINION! Let me explain!!!! 🚨🚨📢⚠️

I've yet to ever find a single manga, light novel, or anime about losing weight through hard work. Not even a good film or TV series that tells the story of someone that goes from obese to a fit athlete 🥋 or assassin 🔫or swordsman 🗡 or what have you...

via exercise, nutrition, addressing the lifestyle diseases associated with obesity, and struggling with motivation like I do. 

It could be a very inspiring, informative, and extremely entertaining story. Hell, I can't find a decent fiction book with that premise. It's such a shame!

Perhaps I'll use some of my savings to hire a ghost writer. I can brainstorm a great plot, and great dialogue, but there are dozens of other factors at play you need to study and learn at a deep level in order to write a great novel.

I'll find a talented ghost writer who loves the ideas for it, that will write passionately about it. Well, ghost writers tend to turn down offers for books that they don’t find interesting, unless someone offers them an insane amount of money to write something they don't really want to write... but they want the 💵💵💵💰💰💰🪙💸😊"
