108759,amoxKCk-EfM,UgxO_3ykg9oQ_8JauMF4AaABAg,2021-08-01T05:45:24Z,1,0,"🔥🔥 Yes!! I'm so glad - I've got to experience this awesome thrilling SAO: Alicization Pt.1 & Pt.2 War of the Underworld Arc. best TV on Netflix & Funimation, also shout out to Aniplex ... also the 3 star company Bang Zoom! Entertainment for dubbing this neat series ... I still feel about about the 3rd season about Eugeo death after kiritos swooped in trying to save his bff from danger, even the cardinal death was not said in vain ... in fact kiritos journey still never ending, unrivaled with new foes in check, he kept a cool head & prostitution in battle & fought with Alice Synthesis 30 or Zuberg in battle against the Vector Empires of the Underworld, also known as War of the Underworld Arc. with great old comrades in arm in Alicization world even though battles were tough 😅 { With Kirito being accompanied or looked after by Alice & Her Sister on wheel chair, unfortunate enough for he couldn't snap out of all the pain + suffering he endured during training & battling in Aincrad & The Underworld ... but good lucked seemed to follow him, as for his friends Asuna, Alice, Yui, Everyone on battle plain cheered him on ... including Eugeo as spiritual soul & msg, but best swordman fighter against Gabriel Miller also known as Subtilizer (in Gun Gale Online) and Emperor Vector (in Alicization) Even though Eugeo lost the fight against the pontafex named Quinella also known as the self-proclaimed Administrator his boosted eager never gave up on his bff making the final swift attack or blow on the Prince of Darkness or Hell King Vector his motives is what pushed Kirito to shine + I do hope Eugeo will rest in peace with the remaining memory image soul of Alice Zuberg in Heaven somewhere ~ who knows maybe he'll return back to Season 5 ... but one can only know what future lies } Anyways battle was over the dark king was defeated in combat + Project Alicization was saved as AI of Human industry, but not as slave or misregarded human being, but as equal statures to those who or everyone applied to except AI as individuals artificial fluctlights as Human Beings too thanks to professor Professor Koujiro Rinko + with the help of Akihiko the bot, he sacrifice his life to protect everyone & more as artificial soul implanted by the memories he passed on since death came etc. even so everyone knows the risk when temporarying with Pandora's Box if soul's crossed one another as artificial fluctlights ... moving on Koujiro Rinko hid his identity for meantime to justify his case on project Alicization + to protect to suburb of this experiment successful with help of Takeru Higa. } Anyhows I'll rap this up short ain't wanting to spoil fans on every detail, but as for Kirito & Asuna they do return to real world & not VR anyhows ... Alice becomes part of kirito, asuna school as well as rest with same uniform etc. they celebrate & kirito gets surprised when Alice comes out of the package box (OMG spoilers 😳) Sorry guys needed to intervene, unfortunate I'm mostly writing an article not even close to an essay, anyways Kirito, Suguha Kirigaya, his mom & dad chat quietly & discuss topics about life etc. and apparently kiritos wants stay in school keep to his engineering career & study at Rath Institute of Project Alicization ... Alice becomes part of kiritos life & two become well acquainted with each other not fonded, just as brother & sister type of thing sort of ... as for Kirito he still hasn't forgotten the time & memories trapped in The Underworld & Alicization! To Be Continued ... Kirito Will Return Pt. 3 coming soon to 2022 as an official season 5 JP premiere scheduled. 🙌 💖 🙏🙏 ( Hope you guys enjoyed my longtime dialog & presentation on my thoughts of Sao season 3 & 4. )"
