181444,1FcVJxxPWh4,Ugz63bW2ZbQxQnEDanB4AaABAg,2025-12-30T02:30:57Z,0,0,"I love this anime not only for its sweetness, but for its writing. Rintaro and Kaoruko save each other without realizing it. Rintaro is lonely and depressed, and when he meets Kaoruko, he finds a reason to love and live again. But long before that, Kaoruko was saved by him. Struggling with her mother’s illness and having no friends, she wandered into a warm cake shop after visiting the hospital, broke down crying, and was comforted by a kind boy—Rintaro. That moment stayed with her.
        The opening and ending songs reflect these “saving” encounters: the OP is about depression until light breaks through the clouds, while the ED is about a girl whose sadness is eased by the memory of the man who saved her, giving her something to look forward to. As Kaoruko said,
       “Experiencing the end of something is lonely, for sure. But then, we just have to create more things to look forward to. If we do that I think we’ll have fun forever and ever.”"
