166873,wwKZYTsxIhk,UgzDrsy8N5fVjHilDgJ4AaABAg,2024-04-05T09:37:17Z,2,2,"I remember hearing from people that this was one of the BEST Isekai ever made, I think even saying it was among the first that was ever done very well. That alone got me excited for it...

Then the first season came out. It blew me away with literally *everything.* The animation quality, the voice acting, the story, the idea, the realistic reactions, actually HUMANLIKE characters that has even has flaws! Rudy is no where near perfect, but he can use that to his advantage to throw off a woman attacking him (which I laughed incredibly hard at!).

This truly is one of the best anime. It even has its own animation studio dedicated to nothing else but to anime this, filled with experienced animators, some even being one of the best!

I cannot wait for this next part of the second season, and for those who have not seen it and are somehow reading this, WATCH THE SHOW! It's worth your time and then some!"
