166873,qs6ZUN_aNAQ,UgyS6fWV_SNaTNy5HXB4AaABAg,2024-02-29T04:27:21Z,1,1,"So... at the current adaptation rate, each half-season adapts three light novels.
- Season 1 Part 1 adapted LNs 1 - 3.
- Season 1 Part 2 adapted LNs 4 - 6.
- Season 2 Part 1 adapted LNs 7 - 9.
- Season 2 Part 2 will likely adapt up through the end of LN 12.

Based on that rate, Season 3 Part 1 will go up through LN 15.
Season 3 Part 2 will go up through LN 18.
Season 4 Part 1 will go up through LN 21.
Season 4 Part 2 will go up through LN 24.
Then Season 5 will adapt the remaining two LNs, and will likely be either a slightly long single-cour season or a short, non-split double-cour season. Or a typical half-season concluded with a movie.

But yeah, Season 2 Part 2 is going to be PACKED with big moments and reveals."
