  When I learned that the disease at first sight and crying in front of the world with me has no cure, it grows with me year by year as (Will) said: Until the last breath without water drowns me 💔😢

 then everything changed.

 my view of the world.
 my view of the future.
 my view of beauty.

 Even now every day as Stella
 He said: I live with my treatments💊💉
 Every day we spend our days with my friend (Oxygen) between four walls⏳

 Despite all the discomfort I feel in this film, I still want to watch it every day because every scene is a comfort to me. I understand that I am not alone in this strange situation of life"
