108430,24YrEAGF32M,Ugx1t6MnlKOlOJPIrHV4AaABAg,2021-11-01T04:55:02Z,0,0,"Umm.. might be the only person.. but this movie and the scene about the to-do list helped me a lot and gave me hope. I was really inspired about her use of a journal to put her to-do lists on, one for long-term, and one for daily. I actually just started using a notebook just for that reason because of this scene. I like crossing out things as I finish, and it makes me happy when I have finished all the tasks I need to do that day. It really helps, especially with having OCD and Anxiety. Thanks for this movie, it really helped me and made me realize the importance of relationships, human touch (hugging, snuggling, kissing, holding hands, etc..), self-care..... and not just living to do treatments for whatever condition you have, but doing those treatments so that you can actually live. 

Phenomenal movie, and I wish they would make a sequel about where Stella is now, and maybe even a spin-off series with a new, young character that watches Stella's videos to help them live with Cystic Fibrosis. Or maybe a spinoff where there is this person that has a deadly contagious disease and cannot go around ANYONE. I would definitely watch it.

