142770,6R6q2fAp2n4,UgyePEpD6cuK-lyyT9h4AaABAg,2023-01-23T23:31:47Z,19,0,"What I love about Makoto Shinkai's characters is that both the girl and guy have interesting personalities. Just like in Your Name, no one is a b*tch or a-hole. Usually, the guy or girl had a bad personality at first and will change because they fell inlove which is a childish cliche trope imo. Makoto Shinkai's characters already have interesting pleasant personalities even before falling inlove and they used it not just for each other but also for helping the people around them. Both are good and both are contributing for each others' character development. This is what most wattpad or any fanfictions have failed to do."
