Now coming home from the 5th rewatch and not stopping yet.

Ngl, Vampire Slayer ... I meant *Demon* Slayer is among the very few post-2010 series made with genuine heart and sincerity in my book. It follows a relatively simplistic plot and has only familiar elements and typical characterization, yet combined together and enhanced by the awesome animation, it's easily a masterpiece of its own kind. Its relatively tight pace and manageable length keeps the fun without the daunting experience of long term commitment. Absolutely a best of its own kind."
