178788,x7uLutVRBfI,UgwOGUuvQOI2CooqtLJ4AaABAg,2025-09-24T17:43:20Z,1,0,"I watched the movie and found it above average maybe 7/10 but not like a masterpiece, it's not worth the hype, it's at slow pace and normal, I believe they should've continued with the series, felt like I watched 5 episodes of series, there's a difference between a 25 episodes series and 2.5 hrs movie, You can't fill movie with 60-70% backstories, now some mindless fans might say that you are not a true fan, there's a lot more in manga, Yes there would be but not everyone has time or interest to read for hours, those who want it's there for them and then there's series as well, they could've shown such bsckstories in a series and should've focused on Castle for whole time or maybe one story eg akaza should be there but not for everyone fucking demon in between each fight.
Story snd fight of Zenitsu and his brother was not even worth of staying in the movie, the fight was straight and plain, only thing which carried the entire movie was Akaza vs Ziyu and Tanjiro. 
Fight between sonibu and doma was also not as expected, even if you compare these fight with Season 2 Sengoku vs Akaza, S3 Tengen Tanjiro vs Upper 6 Gyutato or S4 fights, those were really good, 
