103047,PUFFMnuOF40,Ugz3Ro21XawnNDjJ2CB4AaABAg,2020-07-18T12:21:13Z,0,0,"I am still grieving over losing everything I loved for year and want cry again 😢😢💔💔. I losing my KyoAni Studio with all beautiful staff and Cameron Boyce who making my beautiful childhood and beautiful life for many years. My heart is still broken and crying for year over everything I loved with KyoAni Studio and staff with Cameron Boyce and all my happiness and my dreams gone forever!! 😭😭😭💔. I was wish for five years to communicate with Futoshi Nishiya the great and beautiful character designer of our Free by Instagram,Twitter and Facebook to thank him and ask to draw my Free's characters for me.I was also very excited for the New Free Movie for Tokyo 2020 Olympic Games very much since 2018 but after what what happened in last fatal and ugly year all my happiness and dreams gone forever too! 😭😭😭. I wish this tragedy which killed all my happiness and my dreams did not happen by rewind time to save all our Beloved KyoAni's lives with Cameron Boyce and undo terrible tragedies and alter time for better if only we have the real Infinity Stones and Kronika's Hourglass or Miracles of God!!! 😭😭😭😭😭😭💔. I AM IN PAIN AND CRY, IT IS IMPOSSIBLE TO HEAL PAIN AND SORROW UNTIL THESE MIRACLES ARE FULFILLED! 😭😭😭😭😭😭. I WON'T ACCEPT LOSING MY BELOVED KYOANI STUDIO WITH ALL LIVES AND MY CAMERON BOYCE!!!! 😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔. I SUFFER FROM DEPRESSION FROM GREAT SADNESS IN MY WOUNDED HEART OVER LOSING THEM AND EVERYTHING I LOVED 💔💔💔😭. TODAY IS NEW TRAGEDY MY DEAR HARUMA MIURA WHY THIS HAPPEN?, WHY ALL PARTS OF MY BEAUTIFUL CHILDHOOD DIES BEFORE MY EYES EVERY DAY? 😭😭😭💔. I WON'T TO LIVE IN THIS UGLY YEAR AND AFTER ANY LONGER, I WANT WITH ALL MY FAMILY AND FRIENDS TO LIVE BEAUTIFUL CHILDHOOD TIMES OF MY 1990'S AND 2000'S WHERE MY CHILDHOOD WAS FULL OF BEAUTIFUL, GREAT HAPPINESS, JOYS AND FUN WITH ALL MY FAMILY AND BEAUTIFUL AND WONDERFUL THINGS WE WERE ENJOY IT VERY MUCH 😭😭💔. WHERE NO SORROWS, TRAGEDIES, SUCH AS LOSING MY CAMERON BOYCE WITH KYOTO ANIMATION AND MANY AND CORONAVIRUS PANDEMIC THAT COMPLETELY KILLED ALL MY HAPPINESS AND MY DREAMS AND OUR LOVED ONES! 😭😭😭💔💔. Since this terrible tragedy that killed my happiness and my dreams, I no longer enjoyed anything for a year 😭😭😭😭."
