105156,UB3JzCvXVEo,UgwKPSG_4K6XS3QjIVV4AaABAg,2023-01-22T19:12:35Z,2,0,"This anime came out at a good time for me and I binged heavily on this during lockdown . I was depressed and angry at mad stuff in my life but when I sat and watched this show I was laughing at another guys shit for the 1st 10 episodes then I gave him deep respect in episode and 11-12. I still re-watch the series now and then to have a good laugh. The Japanese dub is brilliants as always but the English dub… the woman who voices Goddess Rista… nailed it! Absolutely nailed it. The animation is also perfect example of exploring how and when to use facial expressions to further emphasise the madness of the story, insane characters and journey into someone else’s mental challenges and sufferings."
