Announcer:
[We will be relaying today's battle report from the Republic of San Magnolia state military's headquarters]

”我が方の損害は軽微であり，人的損害は皆無”/""Waga hou no songai wa keibi de ari, jinteki songai wa kaimu""

[""The losses on our end are insignificant while personnel-wise, those losses are nonexistent""]

”人道的か先進的な無人機に依る，戦闘に寄り，本日も我が国の死者はゼロ名であります”/""Jindouteki ka senshinteki na mujinki ni yoru, sentou ni yori, honjitsu mo waga kuni no shisha wa zeromei de arimasu""

[""Through the humane and advanced unmanned machines, approaching into battle, our country's casualties for today are zero yet again""]

--------------------------------------

アンリエッタペンローズ/Henrietta Penrose: どうしてそんなに無人機に入り込む訳，レーナ？ /Doushite sonna ni mujinki ni irikomu wake, Lena?

[Why're you so fussed about unmanned machines Lena?]

--------------------------------------

ヴラディレーナミリーゼ/Vladilena Milize: 彼らは無人機じゃないわ．．．/ Karera wa mujinki ja nai wa...

[Those people are not unmanned machines...]

--------------------------------------

クレナククミラ/Kurena(Crenna) Kukumila: なんであんな女と毎晩毎晩．．．明日死んじゃうかもしれないのに！ /Nande anna onna to maiban maiban... Ashita shinjau kamo shirenai no ni!

[Why do we have to with that woman, night after night... Even when we might just end up dead tomorrow!]

--------------------------------------

アンジュエマ/Anju(Ange) Emma: 誰に豚と物知られようと，消して豚にはなりさがらない/Dare ni buta to mono shirareyou to, keshite buta ni wa narisagaranai

[Even if someone comes to be known as a pig, they will never be reduced to the level of one]

--------------------------------------

ライデンシュガ/Raiden Shuga: ここでレーギオンと戦って死ぬか，諦めて死ぬしか道がねぇなら，死ぬ時まで戦い生き抜いてやる．それが俺達の戦う理由で誇りだ/Koko de Legion to tatakatte shinu ka, akiramete shinu shika michi ga nee nara, shinu toki made tatakai iki nuite yaru. Sore ga oretachi no tatakau riyuu de hokori da

[Whether we fight the Legion and die here, or give up with death as the only way, we'll keep on fighting until it's time to die. That's both our reason for fighting and our pride]

--------------------------------------

ヴラディレーナミリーゼ/Vladilena Milize: その果てに，死ぬしかないと分かっていてもですか？ / Sono hate ni, shinu shika nai to wakatteitemo desu ka?

[Towards that end, even when knowing that you will all just die?]

--------------------------------------

セオトリッカ/Theoto Rikka: アンタ，僕達が望んで戦ってるとでも思ってるのか?　アンタ達が確かめて，戦えって強制して，この九年何百万人も死なせてんだ！？ / Anta, bokutachi ga nozonde tatakatteru to demo omotteru no ka? Antatachi ga tashikamete, tatakaette kyousei shite, kono kyuu nen nan byaku man nin mo shinaseten da!?

[You think we even wished to fight? It's you all that made sure we fight through force, how many millions of people did you let die these past nine years!? ]

--------------------------------------

ジェロームカールシュタール/Jerome Karlstahl: 自由や平等など早過ぎたんだよレーナ．　我々人類には恐らく永遠に．．．/Jiyuu ya byoudou nado hayasugitan da yo Lena. Ware ware jinrui ni wa osoraku eien ni...

[Freedom, equality and the like were too early for us Lena. Perhaps for humanity, that would take forever...]

--------------------------------------

ヴラディレーナミリーゼ/Vladilena Milize: 守らせる為でもなく，死なせる為に戦わせるなんて．．．そんな物虐殺ではありませんか！？ /Mamoraseru tame demo naku, shinaseru tame ni tatakawaseru nante... Sonna mono gyakusatsu de wa arimasen ka!?

[To think that it is not even for the sake of protecting them but for the purpose of having them die... Is something like that not genocide!?]

--------------------------------------

シンエイノウゼン/Shinei Nouzen: 俺達は漸く自分が行こうと思った所まで，行こうと思った道を辿って行けるんです．/Oretachi wa youyaku jibun ga ikou to omotta tokoro made, ikou to omotta michi wo tadotte ikerun desu

[We are finally going to that place we had thought of, and we will be able to follow that path through to it]

いつか．．．俺達が行き着いた場所まで来たら，花でも供えてくれませんか？ / Itsuka... Oretachi ga ikitsuita basho made kitara, hana demo sonaete kuremasen ka?

[Someday... If you arrive at that place we were headed towards, would you mind offering up flowers for us?]

--------------------------------------

