114308,C27bHIDFU9Q,Ugxxc3_ZC8sYFbGsTZN4AaABAg,2020-07-07T20:13:43Z,74,2,"Damn.. this anime has come a long way.. Kirito made a lot of friends, people who cherish and love, people he saved. If they didn’t support him, no one could have gotten this far. The nostalgia of this anime is extreme... this was the first anime I have watched. Seeing the story change and evolve really makes me think about the old times but I have to move on forward. The characters, just like in real life, was able to go through many obstacles because of their friends. The strong will to never give up, the support, and love connects them all together. This anime got me through many hard times because I can relate to the characters. SAO is not the same as most anime, it’s very special because Kirito worked harder than anyone else in order to get where he is now. He cared more about others than himself. Because many friends of his died due to his own “faults” sometimes you have to reveal secrets you don’t wanna reveal in order to save others. I don’t know what I’m saying anymore, but know this, you have a great day and be positive.. not too much but if you’re going through hard times right now, know that there will be more hard times. But if you never give up and go through those hard times, you will be far more stronger than before, goodbye."
