131942,EeCX8Y0a278,UgwSgJB2lX5jdMHX7k94AaABAg,2024-06-04T18:00:47Z,0,0,"One thing I would like to say is that Jojo's  family tree is insane.

First is Jonathon(Excluding Dio)
Second his son and Giorno(Dio with Jonathon's body, his son, technically).
Third is Joseph Joestar 
Fourth is Joseph's daughter and Josuke.
Fifth is Jotaro 
Sixth is Joleyne.

Irrespective of Jonathon and Joseph, Jotaro is the eldest one(excluding Joseph's daughter, who is Jotaro's mom). While Josuke is Jotaro's uncle and Giorno is Jotaro's Grandfather's uncle. Technically Joseph's uncle too.

This is really Jojo's Bizarre Adventures."
