131942,EeCX8Y0a278,UgybzgELkFA7KjcDf9x4AaABAg,2021-11-30T11:56:36Z,11,4,"Watching Stone Ocean trailer everyday until first 12 episodes come out December 1st 2021!! Day 112!!
(I'm so happy this ended in a even number y'all)



(Also get ready cuz this one is gonna be real cheesy, like ""the real stone ocean was the friends we made along the way"" cheesy)

I can't believe this is the last day... I'm honestly really proud of myself for being able to do this everyday, considering I am a very forgetful person, I just proved to myself I can do anything if I commit to it!

Sometimes when I scrow down I see some of my old comments, I wonder if anyone in the future will see them too? Or will they be burried and forgotten in time?

 Well I have a feeling I won't forget this so easily! Sure I won't remember everyday but I'll still remember the journey and the people, just like Irene in a way!

So I would like to thank everybody who is just as exited or even more than I am for Stone Ocean, all the kind (aku, vibing, fo nix and others!) and even unkind people (not gonna drop any names lol) who I talked to throughout this comment section, and all the people who liked my comments or even took the time to read them! Thank you!

Happy Stone Ocean day tomorrow!! I have a feeling this is gonna be made in heaven! 🦋🦋🦋🦋🦋"
