131942,EeCX8Y0a278,Ugz_R_EjcDCm-21kcKZ4AaABAg,2021-11-19T06:33:48Z,109,9,"12 days before stone ocean premieres

stone free is easiest one of the best stands in jojo. araki has trended more to giving his MC’s powerful, ill defined, and unbeatable stands because that’s what fans mostly want. but with stone free, string is a really easy thing to wrap your head around. there are so many epic scenes with jolyne using stone free in a creative way and it makes you think like “woah, I honestly didn’t think of that.”

just like for example, she used stone free to create a bridge in ff arc when she was about to save ermes, she uses her strings to send secret messages, she can clump her strings into a woven thick thread to protect herself from bullets, she can be a portable printer by using binary codes. her stand is very useful and creative. it fits her very very well."
