There is a time in the life of every young jojo fan where they must face: Is jojo gay or european? Well, in some of those cases, he isnt european at all!

8-Gappy: Gappy is not only the straightest jojo, but the straightest part of them all! While part 2 had flamboyant italians to keep you from not having any canonical gay characters, Yasuho being the closest jobro in jojolion means fans have no choice but to sail the hetero ship
7-Johnny: Othet than yasuhoxgappy and erinaxjonathan, i dont ship any of the jojos, so I thought it would be fun to ship the two main guys in sbr, but when I actually readed it, I didnt see anything other than a rlly great friendship  

