114963,aXc9DVfLTGo,UgzWKyNIjd-ouAI1O8t4AaABAg,2023-04-24T03:24:36Z,0,0,"Damn, now this reminds me of the movie BELLE. Such an storm of emotions that have readers laughing, crying, and learning along with the charactures in the movie. This one does have a lesson in it. ""Always value the ones who stand next to you your whole life then the ones who dont, weather they be friend, family, or both. For they would go through thick and thin with you before you relise their worth"". Its like saying I didnt love my mother because she keps obsessing over my safety. But when your all alone on a long road at night and some stalker is following you, im sure you'll hear the words of your mother telling you what to do. Only then do you appreciate it more. Reguardless of the story, never take for granted the good things."
