114963,aXc9DVfLTGo,UgzGDdHMWiE8nSDHGBp4AaABAg,2020-07-03T03:24:58Z,1,0,"This movie was an actual masterpiece. Seriously. I would summarize it here right now, but I don't want to spoil it. So I will just give a short, not-very-spoilery exposition summary




Muge is a middle school girl who believes no one around her loves her, but one day during a festival she got a mask which turns her into cat when she puts it on. Sometime after that (still during the festival)  Hinode finds her in some dirt as a cat. Hinode shows her affection as a cat, and she instantly falls in love with him. While he hates her as a human due to her constant want to be around him and be annoying for no apparent reason, he is in awe of the cat Muge, or Taro as he named her. This leads to Muge believing life as a cat would be much better.

Now I'd tell you the rest, but that must be for you to see. Please watch it, please. I loved this movie so much, especially since I relate to Muge a lot."
