163139,T4luSeIM8EY,Ugw6OH_nzwL8M7u8tWV4AaABAg,2024-04-06T22:57:31Z,0,0,"Let the REAL spring Anime season begin! 
MHA is where it all started for me. And honestly, now since AoT is over, I only really look forward to finishing: Demon Slayer, MHA, That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime, Jujutsu Kaisen, Spy Family, and Mushoku Tensei. 
(I would add HxH to the list (my absolute favorite) but Hiatus X Hiatus isn't going to ever finish). These are the only shows that still give me goosebumps when they're on. 

Besides those I mentioned, the rest of the shows out now are either just fun to watch, or mediocre. ""Chainsaw Man"" DIDN'T come through with the hype as promised. That's the fans fault for over-hyping it beyond expectations. It just didn't execute like they said it would. Only the last 5 episodes were worth watching and actually interesting. And ""Solo Leveling"" is ok so far, we'll see how it goes in the 2nd season."
