111762,_nVe995f9HQ,Ugyzf77cDFSxXdYOrUl4AaABAg,2019-11-20T13:50:00Z,741,28,"Watching this and seeing some of the clips, I realise they're actually gonna finish the manga in 2 seasons, I just pray it's not rushed.
This gonna sound weird but you know one thing I love about this anime (or at least the manga especially) but does anyone else love the fact every character has a set wardrobe of clothes?
If you're wondering what I mean, most anime characters have a costume that they wear night and day except of special filler or finale episodes but literally the characters of Fruits Basket have a handful of tops, a handful of bottoms and they mix and match their clothes throughout the story, so see Yuki in his white Chinese styled top and black trousers and then the next day he's wearing the same trousers but he's put on a different top or vice versa, like real people, for some reason that's always impressed me and makes me happy, don't ask me why."
