106479,8CqSiRk1Jek,UgxktszL96XQn0iTgpp4AaABAg,2023-02-26T19:26:32Z,0,0,"advice for watching this anime: completely forget and ignore the fact that it takes place in a game


1) why does mc talk like the game has a pain feature
2) why does the game have a pain feature
3) why does the game allow players to max out any one of their stats in the character creation (even if she can still spend more points in vit, having 100 in vit makes her invulnerable to pain and i guess pain means damage in this vrmmorpg so im counting that as reaching the soft cap)
4) why does the game lets you make your own name but not what your character looks like
5) mc is a psychopath and a dumbass - she stood still for 5 minutes deciding whether or not to wait for her friend or remake her character and later spent a further hour doing nothing but letting a rabbit attack her and her being like ""you can do this!"" and she fell asleep in a game where her consciousness transfers into said game while being attacked by several monsters (if the game is anything similar to sao, it would stimulate nerve cells to trick the brain into feeling so it would also make her stay awake due to feeling the other monsters atleast touch her, unless the anime means to say she feels absolutely NOTHING) and she also ATE a poisonous dragon instead of just biting a chunk and throwing it away
5) why does the game give the player a skill thats only available to anyone who maxed out their defense, the skill being - doubling their vit (and in extension, their defense)
6) why does the game give an almost instant skill that makes one resistant to a status effect (which then levels up further after she gets hit with it three times)
7) if youre gonna make a game like this then why make it so that the player gets certain skills when they do anything other than play the game, i know afk farming exists but how does that work in a game like this
8) the meditation skill has no cooldown, even though its an active skill
9) how can she one-shot two different enemies if she never put any points into any stat that governs attack damage, and that too with a knife (it wouldve been passable had she used her shield like the slimes and the rabbit)
10) she got a skill called shield attack but she wants a proper form of attacking
11) why does the dragon only give a poison status effect and not any other elemental damages
12) she cant attack the dragon using her hands but can bite chunks off of it... which is a form of attacking... even though she never put any points into a stat that governs attack damage
13) the first time im seeing an mmo game reward a player for playing solo
14) the reward is completely broken, equipment that never breaks but can degrade, and whenever it degrades, it instantly repairs itself (if its gonna be like that then why not just make it so that degradation doesnt affect it) while also becoming stronger whenever it gets damaged
15) this feels like sao without the ""you die in game, you die in real life"" and the mc is a wholesome mary sue who is a psychopathic dumbass
16) why are there no npcs or even tutorial sections to atleast let the player know the minimal basic information of how the game works and how to play it"
