136804,JW0FrUYCkYQ,UgzRV65q8_nYxBRYiDF4AaABAg,2023-05-25T20:39:07Z,2,0,"There’s stuff left out from the LN, like the jokes and other important stuff, like Bukkorori’s importance, the mana detonation, etc (which also wasn’t in the manga.) 4:31 - It’ll likely be 12, since they did 12 for this and it’d be enough for two LNs again. 8:59 - I say Zesta’s worse, he also has more magic. Cecily also thought Zesta wanted tiles cleaned, when he wanted a full description of Megumin’s naked body, so he’s far more of a pervert. Still a better adaptation than Season 1 and 2. As for Komekko’s interlude during the LNs, I think they covered everything. Cecily’s Interludes still need to happen, though, so they’ll likely do the same as Komekko’s and compile them into a single scene later (it’s not like these interludes were that long in the LNs.) As a whole, I vastly prefer KonoBakuen over the main anime, too many cut content and other important minor scenes that connect to others (they kept the second Dark God being freed reveal, so that ties into Combatants and Serena.)"
