109963,WcTl85qHc8Y,Ugx986eCWmSvCGgey_h4AaABAg,2019-10-09T13:07:29Z,0,0,"First anime ive ever watched that included a scene on racism and even one of sexism. I wish more anime would be brave enough to do such things. The vibe of this show kinda reminds me of kakegurui, but i like this show better than that. Kakegurui is more grotesque and has ppl going batshit crazy type of scenes but the suspense and dialogue is somehow abit similar. Both shows are very sexual which annoy me sometimes but sometimes idc. I like kakegurui as well cos its very entertaining and suspenseful but food wars just has that heartwarming factor. I also feel like the main character in food wars is more likable and wholesome as well. Also there were many scenes that made me genuinely laugh out loud. Highly recommend watching this."
