142984,7n9JGuR0HrY,Ugz4Ldcdm3GHz-UvWWB4AaABAg,2022-10-18T20:29:53Z,2,0,"Often, I feel, why do I did not discover this anime/manga back in 2016. I want to feel the longing for this anime, the deep love for this anime, I want to feel a very deep connection to this anime. I want to feel what old fan of komi feels.

But I can't. But at least, something I am still feel very grateful, is that I found Komi san. This, is one of the best things in my life.

Komi can't communicate has many relateable moments to me, the social anxiety, the constant worry about what other people think, the struggle to make friends. It all seems relateable to me.

Although I did not suffer this from a kid (since I used to be an extrovert), I recently felt this social anxiety in 2018 (now i'm 19). 

To this day, I still strive to push myself to change for the better. To talk more with people and overcome my anxiety. Komi can't communicate had gave me a sense of comfort and hope, knowing that I am not alone in a sense and the community of Komi san has face similar experience. 

I found comfort, home, and hope in this anime/manga and its fanbase.

So, although I did not discover this earlier (WHICH I REALLY WISH FOR). I still am grateful I discover this wonderful miracle, for this anime/manga means so much to me. I really, really, really love this anime. I really am. 

Also, the romantic relationship between Komi and Tadano, is one of the best I've ever seen. And it is my dream, to have that kind of relationship.

To be there for someone, helping them, to live a happier life, is a wonderful thing to me. Tadano is also, what I take as an inspiration and idol as a man I want to be. Of course, not everyone is perfect, Tadano has good qualities that is good to be an example.

Thankyou Tomohito Oda, for creating this wonderful masterpiece and all friends in Komi can't communicate  community."
