141014,eOsC5OotBoA,UgwLY_euTZSVcuWaloF4AaABAg,2023-08-26T19:51:25Z,2,1,"This opening is such a good op man... and the series tho oh my god... Trust no one literally, from the first episode it taught us that. and Yuuichi definitely MC of the year.
Also the series had some of the great plot twists i have seen in a long time in anime.
The 3 arcs that it shown, the first game was so good, the second one ending holy sh*t hahaha and the last one it was good but wished we could see the cracked side of Yuuichi more... with the cliffhanger we need a 2nd season fast.

.
Bruh Yuichi one of the chad mc of recent years, literally will save his friend but will do anything to win in the game, giga brain... instantly switches to devil mode holy... Tenji a chad too when you think he was left alone for 5 days without  food and water and still didnt betrayed Yuiichi. Shiho, loves Yuichi, waifu? maybe? beautiful and smart as heck. and definitely is someone guilty as heck as her and her father suspected of having involvement in the game. we need to know more of her. Kokorogi another waifu who also loves Yuiichi, timid but i think theres some secret she is hiding hmm. i feel bad for Shibe, seems nice guy ;_; he suffered so much. we have to rescue him in 2nd season.
.
In the whole series i was totally hyped and ready to see what dance will Yuichi show us next. and with the trust no one mentality and plot twists the series just became more awesome.
Maybe Yuichi not be in the first half of 2nd season if it arrives but we need 2nd season fast..."
