125426,cvZ9thKolOA,UgxgqHSbp3tz8PkGAJN4AaABAg,2022-04-30T08:54:20Z,0,0,"Just my own analysis about this animation and animation comic going around 1 year ago:

                          I think they didn't try to promote this animated comic as an anime.

They probably didn't expect the title to affect the animated comic since one mistake can affect something or leave an impact. 

What they should've done is put the ""Animated Comic"" in the title/description. 

Instead of: The Way of the Househusband | Trailer | Netflix Anime
It should've been: The Way of the Househusband | An Animated Comic Trailer | Netflix Anime

It would've been more clearer for the audience

I'm just trying to explain something.
Just trying to explain what I've seen/read in this trailer's comments
I'm sorry if my explanation is really bad
If you hate my analysis, don't post a hate comment. It's not like I'm sensitive. 
We all have our own different approach/responses/opinions about this animated comic
If this animated comic is not your cup of tee, it's okay. We all have different preferences and I respect your opinion, as long as it's not biased/prejudice/out of hate. :)

This is my perspective and thank you for reading! Just tell me if I missed something. I do not know everything after all. :)"
