125426,cvZ9thKolOA,UgxDROKNcUSlzEoeMx14AaABAg,2022-01-04T16:15:50Z,0,0,"This is a funny, well written, well conceived ""amime-comic."" The character throws all is mafia energy into his new role with compulsive and irrestible force.  His posture, facial expression, mannerisms, & yakuza jargon make for hilarious situations that even though repeated, never cease to be funny.  When he sings happy birthday underlit by the cake candles so that he looks like he crazed murderer, you can't stop laughing. He is an extraordinary character fiercly loyal to his wife, beloved by the neighborhood housewives who know his kitchen talents and 100% committed to making the perfect meal. He even studies nutrition! Best of all: he is never intimidated."
