128705,IV0-SYn3YuM,UgzMYfw_uouKy7gxyul4AaABAg,2021-12-11T19:25:14Z,1,1,"This may be a hot take but i think the anime is pretty good, maybe even better than the manga. Before you guys kill me hear me out. I started watching the anime first, then decided to go the manga when I read about it online, so it could be a reason. For me personally, the music and voice acting made the scenes more impactful. I read the manga online and tbh the scenes just didnt hit as hard. Im not saying the anime adaptation is incredible but i think that it's atleast faithful and isnt as bad as most people are making it out to be.

I really enjoyed the blue period anime and I will probably read on the manga when it finishes airing. I would also like to say that for many people anime is an easier medium to get into than manga so i think we shouldnt shit on the manga. Im sorry to all the manga readers who loved this series and got a meh adaptation. Anyways, at the end of the day all that matters is that people get into blue period cause it's freaking amazing."
