128705,IV0-SYn3YuM,Ugxe7gSIPsCp-OaBiCt4AaABAg,2021-09-26T08:22:07Z,3,0,"I'm honestly not an emotional person but I'm an artist myself and this manga literally became such a big part of my life. I almost cry every time I rewatch this trailer or read the comments. It makes me so happy to see others who think the same, or people who started drawing just because of this.

This manga isn't only about art, but about the way people struggle privately and about the issues they have and it's one of the reasons why this will forever be one of the greatest things I've ever read.

Blue Period isn't about art, it is art. And I'm so happy that the community is growing because of the anime.

<3"
