128705,IV0-SYn3YuM,UgyRENcQ5a4mrQYNMVB4AaABAg,2021-09-25T08:41:35Z,60,0,"Damn I can’t believe I teared up just from the trailer. As an art student when reading the manga I’ve never felt so appreciated and seen about how stressful and how not fun it can be when it comes to art (especially when you love it) 
It really felt nice how they went with the main character to be someone who wasn’t into art initially. (In comparison to starting with a character who already love and knew art) It makes it easier for viewers who’ll watch the anime or read the manga without any knowledge of being an art student etc to go along the same journey as he did and learn about art from scratch.
I’m so hype for it’s release!!!!"
