103632,geMv8Lwk2sM,UgxtCVX1zyS8UrA-nvJ4AaABAg,2020-09-26T03:03:05Z,1,2,"I'm not entirely sure what species of spider she is. At first I thought jumping spider, mostly because of the pose she strikes 0:22, but her abdomen is a bit too large, and she doesn't have front legs that would match that. Also, no idea what those ears are.

Edit: From what I can find, there doesn't seem to be any specific species of spider used as the basis for the fantasy species know as the taratect. Looking at interviews with the author, they have said that they aren't particularly interested in spiders (despite using one as their mc). I'm guessing they just combined some references they liked, which probably included the jumping spider, considering it is undeniably the cutest type of spider."
