103632,geMv8Lwk2sM,UgzgmHm2o7JlrjacQoB4AaABAg,2020-07-06T20:34:21Z,1,0,"I can't comment on the anime yet since I haven't seen it, but here's a very basic premise based on the books I've read.

It's the perfect story for anyone who's ever gotten deeply invested in a videogames core mechanics and what individual stats do in an RPG setting.

But it's ALSO about how horrifying a player level grinding nonstop would be if the videogame was a real world and what effect that actually has on an environment that isn't made up of infinitely respawning mobs but actual living creatures. It's fascinating!"
