153800,oh7bd-CDY6U,UgzxwwfXsY8lj7igRW94AaABAg,2025-10-26T18:16:23Z,3,0,"If you don’t have the budget, honestly, it’s better not to make the series at all.
What they’re doing with One Punch Man right now is worse than doing nothing.
The animation quality in episode 3, especially the fight between the two ninjas, is terrible.
I haven’t seen something this poorly executed in years — it looks like a sloppy collage, and let’s not even talk about the anatomy and proportions of the characters. AWFUL.
Even AI-generated cutscenes have more life than this.
It’s a real shame, because Yusuke Murata’s original art deserved an adaptation worthy of his level, not this insult to his work."
