153800,_YTSMopxyqY,UgwYdGNtz-shakRt3xl4AaABAg,2025-10-13T09:16:30Z,3,0,"I am writing to express my deep disappointment after watching the first episode of One Punch Man Season 3. After waiting for five years, I had high expectations for this season, especially considering the immense popularity and legacy of the anime.

Unfortunately, the animation quality in the first episode fell far below what was expected. It felt more like watching a PowerPoint presentation than an action-packed anime. The lack of fluid animation. Additionally, the overuse of neon light clips and the lack of a strong narrative or emotional depth in the visuals only added to the disorienting experience.

Given the long wait, it is incredibly disheartening to see such a legendary anime series not live up to its previous standards. As a long-time fan, I truly hope the production team takes these concerns seriously and works to improve the animation in the upcoming episodes.

I understand the challenges of anime production, but I believe that One Punch Man deserves more than what was presented in this episode.

Thank you for your time, and I hope to see significant improvements in future episodes."
