153845,rpGAv-7i4tI,UgxpgCQUJX03TaGo7Fh4AaABAg,2023-03-22T15:14:37Z,197,13,"In case any of you didn’t know, the author this series’ original web novel is also the same author as the Fruit of Evolution (they’re called Miku and, on top of that, they play an extra in Fruit of Evolution Season 1 credited as “Man with mohawk” in episode 3, 11 and 12). 
In fact, both series have a lot of similarities, namely that the main characters of both series starts off as a fat unpopular kid at high school who is constantly bullied and beat up every single day only to get Isekai’d and become the most OP (and most attractive) person in all of existence. Oh, and all the hot girls want them."
